WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:01.520
What should I do?!

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:03.650
Takuto was trying to get rid of me...

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.810
...and go with Mitsuki to her audition.

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:07.020
I wouldn't let it happen.

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:08.230
After that...

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.900
...I kept them from getting to their destination...

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.430
...and did everything I could to accomplish my mission.

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:13.600
It went well.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.910
By the time the two finally got there...

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:17.450
...the audition was over...

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.710
...and someone had already been chosen.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.450
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.820
Do you understand?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes.

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:05.840
The Image Character for Mermaid Tear is...

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:08.720
...Wakamatsu Madoka-kun.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.270
No way...

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:28.030
I completed my mission, right?

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:40.420
Madoka-san!

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:41.920
Over here please!

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.460
Mitsuki!

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.220
Ooshige-san.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:53.560
Hey!

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:54.350
Are you running away?!

00:02:57.350 --> 00:02:58.520
Mitsuki!

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:03.110
You really...

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:04.690
I'm sorry, Ooshige-san.

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:05.990
I'm really sorry.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:09.320
Why didn't you tell me you had throat cancer? {Oh noes, the cat's out of the bag}

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:09.950
Eh?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.230
Ah...

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:14.410
Wakaouji-sensei...

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:16.850
What?!

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:18.710
Anyways, Dr. Wakaouji...

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:21.790
...let's hurry up and take 
Mitsuki-chan to the hospital.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:25.050
Mitsuki-chan... do you mean <i>Full Moon</i>-san?

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.590
Of course I do!

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.430
This girl isn't the Mitsuki-chan that I know.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:30.050
Eh?

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:34.470
Who are you anyways?

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:35.930
What are you talking about?!

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:37.640
She's the one and only Mitsuki, of course!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:38.940
Run for it!

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:39.480
What?

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:41.360
Mitsuki?

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.650
Wait right there!

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:43.900
Mitsuki!

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.450
Mitsuki?!

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:50.160
Mitsuki!

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.240
It seems like they didn't follow us...

00:03:57.410 --> 00:03:58.580
What should I do?

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:03.130
They're going to realize that <i>Full Moon</i>  and the twelve-year-old me are the same person...

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.750
That's not going to happen!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:05.920
To say you can transform...

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.970
A story that is way too far from reality! {edited}

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:12.590
I can't go back to those two now...

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.430
I can't be <i>Full Moon</i>  now...

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:17.850
Mitsuki...

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:19.640
Huh?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.010
Here.

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:26.650
Don't just stare at the ground.

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:28.030
Let's get our of here.

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:31.660
They're a little big, so you'll have to make do.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:36.490
Well...

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:38.750
Sometimes... I just want to leave this behind...

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.620
...and help that girl do what she wants...

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.380
It's sad, but...

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:47.210
...it'll be impossible to be <i>Full Moon</i>  now...

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.640
Hurry up, Dr. Wakaouji!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.560
That girl couldn't have gotten very far yet!

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:57.870
Like I said...

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:01.060
I came to search for Mitsuki-chan, not <i>that </i> girl.

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:01.850
Like I said...

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:03.020
That <i>is </i> her!

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.770
I believed you on the phone, but...

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:08.480
...I hadn't seen her yet, so I guess this couldn't have been helped.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:12.650
Anyways, I'm going to search for Mitsuki-chan by myself.

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:13.110
Ah.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:14.410
Dr. Wakaouji!

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:17.740
Geez...

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:19.910
Then... I'll search by myself too!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:34.760
You moron!

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:38.810
Man!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.430
What are you spacing out for... that was dangerous!

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.520
Now's not the time for you to die yet!

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:46.400
You...

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:47.650
You...!

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:48.230
Hey.

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:49.520
Isn't that <i>Full Moon</i> ?

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:50.360
What?

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:51.440
She can't be.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:53.400
There's no way she'd be in a place like this.

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:54.360
But...

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:06.920
Madam...

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.710
Some iced tea...

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:09.800
I'm fine.

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.840
But... aren't you tired from walking?

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:13.920
It's all right.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:29.770
I see...

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:30.940
You haven't seen her?

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:31.980
Thanks.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:43.790
Yes.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:49.000
Our office is still refraining from commenting on <i>Full Moon</i>.

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:50.000
No.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.380
How can you still say that?!

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:52.010
Yes.

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:53.090
Yes!

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:53.960
That's all, then...

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:55.800
Man...

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:57.340
How did this happen?!

00:06:57.340 --> 00:06:58.470
I'm very sorry.

00:06:58.470 --> 00:06:59.220
At this rate...

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:01.600
...we'll lose everything we had scheduled for tomorrow.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.430
I understand!

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:05.020
I'll definitely find her before the day's over!

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:07.890
Hey, what's going on?

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:09.980
Hey! That's her manager's car! {start time fixed}

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:11.820
As you can see...

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.360
...a car driven by someone related to <i>Full Moon</i>-san...

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:16.610
...has just rushed off from the office.

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:18.490
Takeda-san...

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:22.370
...you've met with <i>Full Moon</i>-san for your magazine before, right?

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.010
That's right. {missing}

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.500
She hadn't debuted yet, but...

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.620
...she's a very pure and good girl.

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:30.420
That kind of thinking is just naive.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.880
Such pure feelings can't last in show business...

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:36.380
Maybe she just gave up and went home.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:37.890
No.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.680
She sings with true strength from the heart.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:42.890
To think that it would end this way...

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:45.930
I don't want to believe it.

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:52.400
It looks like everything has fallen apart. {edited}

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:55.230
Eichi-kun...

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:57.690
My song probably...

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:00.450
...won't be able to reach you now...

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.040
Where am I?

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:58.720
Ah... I'm inside the lighthouse, huh?

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:03.330
Takuto... where'd he go off to?

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.390
Ah?

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:14.350
The moon pendant Eichi-kun gave me... it's ruined... {edited}

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:22.280
Even though I always... always treasured it...

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.200
That's my song...

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.410
Eh?

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:03.550
Eh?!

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:14.130
What are you doing?

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:14.950
Eh?

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:19.410
Eh?

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:20.610
Well... you see...

00:12:20.610 --> 00:12:24.000
Back in the old days, people used to get up early to catch salmon...

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.550
What are you talking about?

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:34.890
So...

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:36.180
...what are you going to do now?

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:40.270
What should I do...

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:47.400
Get on a boat...

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:48.740
...and sail off to America, huh?

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:49.360
What?

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:51.610
If you try to sing in America...

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:54.200
...you'll get Eichi's attention faster, right?

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:58.040
America, huh?

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.120
Let's do it.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:03.040
Ah?

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.290
Give up here and go to America...

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:06.920
It might be better there.

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:08.590
Mitsuki...

00:13:08.590 --> 00:13:09.960
Ah, but...

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:11.260
Will we be all right?

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:12.550
W-What do you mean?

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:13.970
My English.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:14.640
Huh?!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:17.760
'Cause... "Love Me Do" is read Ra-bu Me Do. {alpha-time}

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:18.130
'Cause... "Love Me Do" is read Ra-bu Me Do. {alpha-time}

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:18.370
'Cause... "Love Me Do" is read Ra-bu Me Do. {alpha-time}

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:18.620
'Cause... "Love Me Do" is read Ra-bu Me Do. {alpha-time}

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:20.560
'Cause... "Love Me Do" is read Ra-bu Me Do. {alpha-time}

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:35.700
You're finally back to normal. {shani: love this part of the episode <3}

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.120
You're best with a smile on your face.

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:42.370
Takuto...

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:52.470
It's beautiful...

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:53.470
Yeah.

00:13:58.550 --> 00:13:59.470
Takuto...

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.390
I...

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:03.060
Wakaouji-sensei...

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:04.520
...and Ooshige-san...

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:06.440
I think I should tell them everything.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:07.610
Huh?

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.440
After I tell them everything...

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:12.320
...it can't be helped if they don't forgive me.

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:15.990
I... still want to sing.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:19.330
But, Takuto...

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.740
You won't be a Shinigami anymore...

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.000
Are you okay with that?

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:26.170
As long as you're doing what you want to...

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:29.840
...I'll keep on following your dream.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:33.670
Thank you, Takuto!

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.760
S-Stupid... don't just hug me for no reason at all!

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:39.220
I like your singing, Takuto.

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:41.010
So you did hear me...

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:43.980
That's 'cause...

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:46.190
...you're a gentle person...

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.190
Someone I can talk to...

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:53.070
You're trying to embarrass me again!

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.900
That's 'cause... it's the truth!

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:23.180
Mitsuki-chan!

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:27.980
Wakaouji-sensei... Ooshige-san...

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:29.770
I'm sorry for causing you so much trouble!

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:30.480
Eh?

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:32.320
Mitsuki-chan... is your fever gone?

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:33.190
What about your cough?

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:34.110
I'm fine.

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.000
Anyways... let's go to the hospital.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.740
I'll call your grandma immediately.

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:38.400
No.

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:39.410
Wakaouji-sensei.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.660
I have something I need to tell you.

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:42.700
What?

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:43.660
You need to tell us something?

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:47.120
Aren't you Mitsuki-chan's little sister, Mikazuki-chan? {Bingo, I was right about the tl error in episode 3, it was fixed at this point}

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.710
That's what you told me when we last met.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:51.920
Sorry...

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:55.050
Back then... I was lying.

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:55.670
What?

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:56.800
Ooshige-san...

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.380
I'm Mitsuki.

00:15:58.380 --> 00:15:59.510
Th-Then...

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:01.640
Who's the <i>Full Moon</i>  I'm always with?

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:02.760
That's also me.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:05.600
There's no way that could be true...

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:08.730
That's what I came to talk to you about.

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:09.600
Mitsuki!

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:13.520
Be strong.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:14.270
Okay.

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:21.030
Wakaouji-sensei...

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:25.120
Do you remember the day I asked you about the audition?

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:25.830
Yeah...

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:26.950
In reality...

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:28.540
After you left...

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:30.540
...something happened...

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:33.750
...right before my eyes...

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:37.000
A Shinigami by the name of Takuto appeared.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:42.970
He told me that I had just one year left to live...

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:48.220
A Shinigami... and that you have only one year left to live...

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.060
That kind of story is...

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:51.560
Let's listen to her story a little longer.

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:53.150
Okay...

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.310
Please go on.

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:55.230
Okay.

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:58.280
After I heard that...

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:03.200
I thought that this would be my only chance to audition and become a singer.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:07.490
But... twelve-year-olds couldn't audition...

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:09.580
So then... Takuto...

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:24.930
Ever since then...

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:29.310
...I've been able to turn my body into that of the sixteen-year-old <i>Full Moon</i>.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:33.690
I'm the only one who can see Takuto, so...

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:37.020
...I know that it's hard for you to just believe what I'm saying...

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:39.360
But if you don't believe me...

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:42.990
...I'll never be able to sing as <i>Full Moon</i>  again!

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:47.950
I understand what you're saying, but...

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:50.740
...can that all be real?

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.130
Oh well.

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.840
If they won't believe your story...

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.340
...we'll just have to show them.

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:02.470
Takuto!

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:03.880
Okay?

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:04.880
Yeah.

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:12.390
Wakaouji-sensei... Ooshige-san...

00:18:12.390 --> 00:18:14.810
My story wasn't a lie.

00:18:15.230 --> 00:18:16.940
Please watch closely.

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:18.400
Takuto...

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:19.440
I'm counting on you.

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:20.230
Okay.

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:46.550
Wakaouji-sensei... Ooshige-san...

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:48.510
This is me as a sixteen-year-old.

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:49.680
Mitsuki...

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:53.310
Do you believe what I say now?

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:05.650
H-Hey... Mitsuki... {start time fixed}

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:07.410
Is this real?

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:10.990
This must be some kind of optical illusion or something, right?

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:16.040
It happened right before your eyes and you still don't believe her!

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:16.710
Ah!

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:17.790
What is this?!

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:18.870
That's Takuto.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:21.090
I'm the Shinigami, Takuto.

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:23.050
This isn't how I usually look...

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:26.880
...but I can only talk to you when I'm in this form.

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:29.720
A-Are you really a Shinigami?

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:31.680
We have no choice but to believe it.

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:34.520
Thanks to Takuto-kun's power...

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.730
...Mitsuki-chan can change into a sixteen-year-old...

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:47.190
But...

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:50.360
...to say that Mitsuki-chan only has one year left...

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.780
That's the only thing that I can't accept.

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:54.450
Despite that...

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:57.120
We can't allow her to use her throat constantly...

00:19:57.660 --> 00:20:00.040
But when she's a sixteen year old...

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:01.790
...she's totally healthy.

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:02.460
What?

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:03.670
Is that true?

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:04.550
Yep.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:06.130
No way... how can that be...?

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:09.470
If you don't believe it, run a test on her later.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:12.680
So, Sensei... I want to keep on singing.

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:13.930
I beg you!

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:17.890
I can't let you, Mitsuki-chan...

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:19.480
Why?!

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:23.520
I'm running out of time.

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:26.440
In the time that I have left...

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:28.240
...I want to keep on singing!

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:32.780
I can't waste a second... I want to tell Eichi-kun how I feel!

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:34.530
And then...

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:35.830
That's not it.

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:36.700
Eh?

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:38.620
It's not about singing and living.

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:40.250
You sing to live...

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:42.540
You live to sing... {To live is to fight, and to fight is to live}

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:44.750
Ooshige-san...

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:49.340
Dr. Wakaouji.

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:52.130
Can't we do something about Mitsuki?

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:55.430
Until Mitsuki's dream comes true...

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:57.310
Just until then...

00:20:58.390 --> 00:21:01.190
I'm begging you, Wakaouji-sensei!

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:03.940
Mitsuki-chan...

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:05.900
...can you give me some time?

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:08.480
I want to think this over.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:12.320
I'd like to do as much as I can for you.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:14.620
It's your life we are talking about here.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:19.160
I want to help your dreams come true.

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:27.170
Dr. Wakaouji seems like a wonderful person.

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:29.550
Cheer up Mitsuki!

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:06.770
Hey, Takuto.

00:23:06.770 --> 00:23:08.190
Is this okay?

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:09.520
Meroko's going to leave.

00:23:09.860 --> 00:23:12.110
What... you're not mad at her?

00:23:12.110 --> 00:23:14.740
It's her fault that you didn't make it to the audition.

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:16.280
That's true, but...

00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:19.320
...Meroko must have had her reasons.

00:23:19.340 --> 00:23:22.450
Man... how long are you going to keep on trusting people?

00:23:22.450 --> 00:23:23.740
It's none of my business now.

00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:26.870
If she wants to come back, she can come back on her own.

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:28.500
Geez, Takuto!

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:30.880
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.380
Meroko, Left Alone
